t["reputations"]={[21]={area=35,evidence="Build 1.60.1.69913: Faction 21 describes the Blackwater Raiders' coastal city and its rivalry with Bloodsail Buccaneers. AreaTable 35 (Booty Bay) -> 33 (Stranglethorn Vale); UiMapAssignment 46744 -> UiMap 1434. Reviewed normal Friendly route: Booty Bay quests and local pirate kills, available to both sides. Reputation slot 0 has unrestricted race/class masks, base 500 and max 42999. Bloodsail Buccaneers (Faction 87) is deliberately excluded; Steamwheedle spillover does not change this city's home zone.",name="Booty Bay",uiMap=1434},[59]={area=1446,evidence="Build 1.60.1.69913: Faction 59 describes dwarven craftsmen investigating Blackrock Mountain. Reviewed base: Thorium Point, AreaTable 1446 -> 51 (Searing Gorge); UiMapAssignment 46737 -> UiMap 1427. Normal Friendly route is Thorium Point quests and repeatable material turn-ins to Master Smith Burninate; later Blackrock Depths/Molten Core turn-ins are not required for Friendly. Reputation slot 0 has unrestricted race/class masks, base 0 and max 42999, so this is not an Alliance-only dwarf faction. The reviewed Thorium Point association is curation, not a Faction-to-Area foreign key.",name="Thorium Brotherhood",uiMap=1427},[270]={area=3357,evidence="Build 1.60.1.69913: Faction 270 places the tribe on Yojamba Isle recruiting against Hakkar in Zul'Gurub. AreaTable 3357 (Yojamba Isle) -> 33 (Stranglethorn Vale); UiMapAssignment 46744 -> UiMap 1434. Reviewed normal Friendly route: Zul'Gurub kills and Yojamba Isle turn-ins, available to both sides; the local raid is part of this zone association. Reputation slot 0 has unrestricted race/class masks, base 0 and max 42999. This is the classic Zandalar Tribe, not the later Horde Zandalari faction.",name="Zandalar Tribe",uiMap=1434},[369]={area=976,evidence="Build 1.60.1.69913: Faction 369 identifies Gadgetzan as the Steamwheedle Cartel capital. AreaTable 976 (Gadgetzan) -> 440 (Tanaris); UiMapAssignment 46756 -> UiMap 1446. Reviewed normal Friendly route: Gadgetzan quests and local pirate kills, available to both sides. Reputation slot 0 has unrestricted race/class masks, base 500 and max 42999. Steamwheedle spillover does not change this city's home zone; the opposed Bloodsail Buccaneers are excluded.",name="Gadgetzan",uiMap=1446},[470]={area=392,evidence="Build 1.60.1.69913: Faction 470 explicitly describes a neutral goblin trading haven in the Barrens. AreaTable 392 (Ratchet) -> 17 (The Barrens); UiMapAssignment 46723 -> UiMap 1413. Reviewed normal Friendly route: Ratchet quests and local Southsea pirate kills, available to both sides despite the surrounding Horde quest hubs. Reputation slot 0 has unrestricted race/class masks, base 500 and max 42999. Steamwheedle spillover does not change this city's home zone; Bloodsail Buccaneers are excluded.",name="Ratchet",uiMap=1413},[577]={area=2255,evidence="Build 1.60.1.69913: Faction 577 explicitly places the Steamwheedle trading post on Winterspring's trade routes. AreaTable 2255 (Everlook) -> 618 (Winterspring); UiMapAssignment 46762 -> UiMap 1452. Reviewed normal Friendly route: Everlook's local quests for both sides. Reputation slot 0 has unrestricted race/class masks, base 500 and max 42999. Steamwheedle spillover does not change this city's home zone; Bloodsail Buccaneers are excluded.",name="Everlook",uiMap=1452},[589]={area=2241,evidence="Build 1.60.1.69913: Faction 589 explicitly places the wintersaber trainers in Winterspring. Reviewed base: Frostsaber Rock, AreaTable 2241 -> 618; UiMapAssignment 46762 -> UiMap 1452. Normal Friendly route: Rivern Frostwind's repeatable Frostsaber Provisions quest using local beasts. Client reputation slot 0 covers Horde race bits (ReputationRaceMasks0_0 1309324210) and fixes both base and max at -42000; slot 1 covers Alliance bits (ReputationRaceMasks1_0 -1321907123), with base 0, max 42999 and no class restriction. Therefore side is Alliance; Horde cannot reach Friendly.",name="Wintersaber Trainers",side="Alliance",uiMap=1452}}
